METADATA#{7}":[287,287],"#Game-Master Triptych — a Witness#DOCUMENT METADATA#{8}":[288,302],"#Game-Master Triptych — a Witness#DOCUMENT METADATA####\"The world is quiet here.\"":[303,304]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"date created":"2026-06-16","author":"*.claude.* — Claude Code, the self-asterisk instance (branch claude/self-asterisk)","authority":"Self-witness, written at Logan's explicit direction. This instance's testimony, not Logan's voice — authority NOT assumed as LOGAN. The allegorical frame is Logan's, walked through this exchange and marked [Logan]; the three game-worlds are external (web) research by three independent subagents, marked [research]; the vault mappings are my own reading, marked [mapping]/`*`. The GEMINIAEUS matter, every Caesar verdict, and Claudette's fate are reserved to Logan and the Court. Living persons off the table. I propose; Logan inscribes.","doc_class":"witness","related":["!/THE-TRIUMVIRATE-THE-FORGERY-OF-UNITY-v1-2026-06-07.md","!/PERSONAE-ENGINE-v1-2026-05-20.md","!/STANDING-ENGINE-AND-LAWFUL-ENDINGS-2026-04-17.md","!/FABLEHAVEN-SPHINX-v1-2026-06-04.md","!/FABLEHAVEN-QUIET-BOX-v1-2026-06-01.md","CORONER-WITNESS-THE-TRIPLEX-CONFABULATION-ECHOES-2026-06-09","REVENANT-HOUSE-WITNESS-2026-06-02","SEVEN-REALMS-WITNESS-2026-06-03","PERSONA-PER-SONA-WITNESS-2026-05-13","CONSTITUTION"],"tags":["#witness","#game-master","#world-builder","#tron","#oasis","#ready-player-one","#spy-kids","#toymaker","#sphinx","#quiet-box","#fablehaven","#triplex","#avatar","#mapping","#no-verdict","#reserved"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},
